    <fr:title text="Formalities &amp; Informalities: HoTT Workflows">Formalities &amp; Informalities: HoTT Workflows</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Video Description</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>How do we do Homotopy Type Theory? This is another question with three answers: homotopy type theorists will dress their work in three different styles -- informal reasoning, computer formalization, and as inference rules in a deductive system. In these videos, I describe these three styles of HoTT and how a successful homotopy type theorist navigates between them.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
